  "trustAndLifecycleMeaning": {
    "core12": "Owned workspace/real encrypted blob writer and ledger verifier, then tamper/plans/apply snapshots. Hold verdict callbacks and receipt SignedDigest signer are injected; receipt signatures are stub strings. fs is an existing plain-object mock for rename spying. Writer/pools are closed before repair; no active-writer race.",
    "builtCLI5": "Actual built dist/cli.js children through the unchanged helper; expected exit0/1/2 results, plan/no-confirmation/receipt/archive-note behavior and one edited-monitor failure message. Local real REPAIR_RECEIPT signature verification and altered-byte refusal are assertions in the passing source case. Inherited environment, per-call AMC_HOME/passphrase and original60s child timeout remain. No independent external issuer/trust anchor, separate child transcript/PID record or active-writer claim.",
